1. DEFINITIONS

"Specification" means the documents, schemas, test vectors, conformance
material and verifier source code published in this repository, at any
version.

"ZIFFER Artefact" means a proposal, decision receipt, policy bundle, audit
record, anchor, notification or acknowledgement whose form is defined by the
Specification.

"Interoperating Software" means software whose purpose is to produce,
consume or verify ZIFFER Artefacts in conformity with the Specification for
use with the ZIFFER service, or to verify a decision receipt issued by it.

2. GRANT

Subject to this licence, code75 SASU grants you a worldwide, royalty-free,
non-exclusive, non-transferable licence to:

  (a) read the Specification;
  (b) copy and redistribute the Specification verbatim, in whole or in part,
      provided this licence and the copyright notice remain attached;
  (c) implement the Specification in Interoperating Software, and run the
      published vectors and conformance material against such software;
  (d) use and modify the verifier source code within Interoperating
      Software.

3. RESTRICTIONS

This licence does not permit you to:

  (a) distribute a modified version of the Specification, or a document
      derived from it, as a specification or standard;
  (b) use the ZIFFER name or mark other than to state truthfully that
      software interoperates with ZIFFER or conforms to a named version of
      the Specification;
  (c) operate, offer or distribute a service or product that performs the
      decision function the Specification describes, namely grading
